# CR 702.19: Rootbreaker Wurm (6/6, Trample) attacks; Devoted Hero
# (1/2, no keywords) blocks. lethalDamage caps what has to reach the
# blocker at 2 (its own toughness, no deathtouch here), and the
# remaining 4 tramples over to the defending player -- CR 702.19b
# (combatdamage.go's own dealAttackerDamage).
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
# One more advance for the state-based-action check that moves the
# lethally damaged creature(s) to the graveyard.
advance
